WEBVTT

01:37.630 --> 01:42.970
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.370 --> 01:46.020
[Episode 25]

01:52.590 --> 01:54.150
I had no idea he was coming

01:54.590 --> 01:55.950
to steal her away.

01:56.759 --> 01:57.430
Shen Run

01:57.950 --> 01:59.640
was simply abusing

01:59.920 --> 02:02.650
His Majesty's authority
and doing as he pleased.

02:02.710 --> 02:04.430
I only found out at the last moment—

02:04.430 --> 02:05.950
there was nothing I could do.

02:05.950 --> 02:08.430
Are you using the new Emperor
to intimidate me?

02:08.430 --> 02:09.120
No.

02:09.520 --> 02:10.560
How would I dare?

02:12.030 --> 02:13.840
The new Emperor had the two of you

02:13.840 --> 02:15.710
return here one after another—

02:16.710 --> 02:18.370
precisely so Shen Run could be

02:18.470 --> 02:20.870
the executioner's blade
meant to cut me down!

02:20.870 --> 02:21.630
And you—

02:22.520 --> 02:26.590
you're the executioner
standing beside that blade,

02:27.000 --> 02:28.280
waiting for the order to strike.

02:28.280 --> 02:29.280
Isn't that right?

02:37.310 --> 02:38.630
My dear brother,

02:38.630 --> 02:41.150
you mustn't frighten me like this.

02:41.430 --> 02:43.079
How would I ever dare?

02:44.430 --> 02:45.470
Brother,

02:45.470 --> 02:47.520
ever since I entered officialdom,

02:47.750 --> 02:51.680
you've always been my greatest support.

02:52.630 --> 02:54.400
Without your backing,

02:55.000 --> 02:56.590
I would be nothing.

02:57.310 --> 03:00.030
It was also your clever strategy

03:00.190 --> 03:02.560
to have me feign loyalty
to the new Emperor.

03:02.560 --> 03:04.520
To put it bluntly,

03:04.870 --> 03:06.360
I'm entirely

03:06.360 --> 03:08.360
at your mercy here.

03:08.590 --> 03:12.250
How could I possibly harbor
the slightest disloyalty toward you?

03:21.030 --> 03:21.840
Jingzhi.

03:21.840 --> 03:22.280
Yes.

03:23.150 --> 03:25.410
We've known each other for over 20 years.

03:25.430 --> 03:27.120
-Yes.
-You know me well.

03:27.680 --> 03:28.470
-Sit.
-I…

03:29.560 --> 03:30.310
Yes.

03:34.000 --> 03:34.870
Brother,

03:35.870 --> 03:37.910
Shen Run

03:38.910 --> 03:41.430
really doesn't know his place.

03:42.400 --> 03:44.310
The moment he brought the Palace Guards

03:44.310 --> 03:45.870
into Hengtang,

03:46.190 --> 03:49.310
he was already in your grasp, Brother.

03:53.310 --> 03:54.910
But I don't think this matter

03:55.360 --> 03:56.520
is that simple.

03:58.360 --> 04:00.120
For him to seize Qingyuan so brazenly,

04:00.120 --> 04:01.320
in front of everyone—

04:01.840 --> 04:02.700
could it really

04:03.590 --> 04:05.560
just be about her?

04:07.590 --> 04:08.080
Then...

04:09.000 --> 04:10.430
He's seen through it.

04:12.120 --> 04:14.800
He's seen through the fact
that we appear to be at odds

04:14.800 --> 04:17.890
but are actually putting on a show
for the new Emperor.

04:19.160 --> 04:21.360
If he really has seen through it,

04:22.680 --> 04:25.040
this matter will become far more serious.

04:27.000 --> 04:27.560
Yes.

04:30.270 --> 04:31.480
Regardless,

04:32.040 --> 04:33.190
that man

04:33.510 --> 04:35.190
is a grave threat to us.

04:35.190 --> 04:36.600
We can't let him live for long.

04:36.600 --> 04:38.190
We can't let him live for long—

04:38.190 --> 04:40.600
is that how you see it?

04:40.950 --> 04:41.600
Yes.

04:41.800 --> 04:43.240
That's what I think too.

04:43.950 --> 04:44.680
But...

04:46.680 --> 04:48.600
he's your new son-in-law.

04:49.680 --> 04:50.740
Could you truly...

04:51.950 --> 04:53.280
bring yourself to do it?

04:59.310 --> 04:59.950
Brother,

05:00.750 --> 05:02.680
Qingyuan is my own flesh and blood,

05:03.000 --> 05:03.630
but

05:04.070 --> 05:05.870
it depends on the matter at hand.

05:06.270 --> 05:10.720
If it comes down to life and death,
the greater good must come first—

05:11.120 --> 05:13.600
I can't afford to
concern myself with much else.

05:13.600 --> 05:15.750
Then she'll just have to suffer for it.

05:16.510 --> 05:17.120
Come on, Brother.

05:17.120 --> 05:18.190
It's a joyous occasion.

05:18.190 --> 05:19.360
-I'm coming.
-Let's have a proper drink.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.220
Where's Yunya?

05:20.560 --> 05:21.270
Yunya!

05:21.680 --> 05:23.240
My Lady, food's ready!

05:23.240 --> 05:24.430
-Yunya, hurry up!
-Food's ready!

05:24.430 --> 05:25.430
We're waiting for you!

05:25.430 --> 05:25.960
Darling!

05:27.190 --> 05:27.920
Coming!

05:31.190 --> 05:31.950
-Darling!
-My Lady!

05:31.950 --> 05:33.159
-These...
-Hurry up!

05:33.159 --> 05:35.040
are my specialties.

05:35.510 --> 05:36.750
Well, not exactly my specialties.

05:36.750 --> 05:38.800
My real specialty is pastries.

05:39.750 --> 05:40.870
Come on, sit.

05:41.950 --> 05:44.040
Rather than exchanging empty pleasantries
with outsiders,

05:44.040 --> 05:47.120
I'd rather have a drink
with you, my family.

05:47.390 --> 05:48.360
-Come on.
-Cheers. Cheers.

05:48.360 --> 05:49.360
-Come on!
-Cheers!

05:49.360 --> 05:51.560
-Come on, to a happy occasion.
-Cheers!

05:55.270 --> 05:58.400
Everyone thinks Commander Shen
is a ruthless official,

05:58.430 --> 06:00.870
but little do they know
that in front of my sister, Yunya,

06:00.870 --> 06:03.510
he's such a gentle and considerate man.

06:05.510 --> 06:06.950
Fangchun, once we part today,

06:06.950 --> 06:08.430
I don't know when we'll meet again.

06:08.430 --> 06:08.870
Come on,

06:08.870 --> 06:10.160
let's have another drink.

06:10.160 --> 06:11.750
-Come on.
-Cheers.

06:16.390 --> 06:17.310
That's enough.

06:17.560 --> 06:19.760
We still have to leave the city tonight.

06:20.000 --> 06:22.720
You think my alcohol tolerance
is as poor as yours?

06:22.720 --> 06:24.720
I'm a legend when it comes to drinking.

06:24.720 --> 06:25.680
I can drink all night

06:25.680 --> 06:26.810
and never get drunk.

06:29.920 --> 06:31.870
Don't just talk.

06:31.870 --> 06:33.000
Have some food.

06:33.000 --> 06:33.950
-Come on, eat up.
-Come on.

06:33.950 --> 06:36.680
-You don't think it's very good, do you?
-Come on.

06:38.159 --> 06:42.159
I nearly forgot about
my specialty herbal chicken soup.

06:42.360 --> 06:44.159
It's still on the stove.

06:44.310 --> 06:45.240
I'll go get it.

06:45.240 --> 06:45.630
-Wait for me.
-Granny.

06:45.630 --> 06:46.750
Eat up, eat up.

06:46.750 --> 06:47.550
Don't mind me.

06:47.720 --> 06:49.950
-Let me help you, Granny.
-I'm so forgetful today.

06:49.950 --> 06:51.210
Let's wait for Granny.

06:51.560 --> 06:53.620
Let me offer everyone another toast.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.270
Come on.

06:55.310 --> 06:55.870
Cheers.

06:57.100 --> 07:06.430
[Shen Residence]

07:01.720 --> 07:02.250
Brother,

07:02.480 --> 07:04.080
no need to see us off further.

07:04.240 --> 07:05.000
Fangchun,

07:05.000 --> 07:06.860
write to me when you have the time.

07:08.160 --> 07:09.120
When we meet again someday,

07:09.120 --> 07:10.190
we should drink together.

07:10.190 --> 07:10.830
Che,

07:11.160 --> 07:12.390
take care of yourself.

07:12.390 --> 07:13.040
Also,

07:13.600 --> 07:15.200
don't forget what I told you.

07:16.870 --> 07:17.400
Brother,

07:17.870 --> 07:18.470
take care.

07:21.510 --> 07:22.310
And you too.

07:25.000 --> 07:25.870
Sister-in-law,

07:25.870 --> 07:27.000
until we meet again.

07:34.820 --> 07:41.140
[Shen Residence]

07:35.190 --> 07:36.390
The road ahead is long!

07:36.390 --> 07:37.520
Until we meet again!

07:43.000 --> 07:44.190
Che seems

07:45.360 --> 07:46.510
different somehow.

07:48.270 --> 07:49.310
Have you noticed

07:49.950 --> 07:52.810
he appears to have
some feelings for Dong Fangchun?

07:53.360 --> 07:53.950
Yunya.

07:56.240 --> 07:57.040
Dear,

07:57.870 --> 07:59.870
I want to hear you call me "Darling."

08:04.080 --> 08:09.300
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

08:06.360 --> 08:07.160
Darling.

08:09.330 --> 08:13.860
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

08:13.880 --> 08:18.180
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

08:18.210 --> 08:22.820
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

08:22.840 --> 08:27.070
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

08:27.100 --> 08:31.660
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

08:31.690 --> 08:36.000
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

08:36.030 --> 08:41.780
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

08:40.960 --> 08:42.490
Isn't this what you wanted?

08:43.960 --> 08:49.190
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

08:45.440 --> 08:46.440
What I want

08:47.200 --> 08:49.220
is a marriage recognized
in name and in law.

08:49.220 --> 08:53.740
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

08:53.760 --> 08:58.070
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

08:58.090 --> 09:02.700
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

09:02.720 --> 09:06.950
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

09:06.980 --> 09:11.540
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

09:11.570 --> 09:15.880
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

09:15.910 --> 09:22.370
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

09:41.270 --> 09:42.150
Dear.

09:52.000 --> 09:52.530
Shen Run!

09:53.120 --> 09:53.750
Shen Run!

09:54.000 --> 09:54.630
Shen Run!

09:58.000 --> 09:58.660
Commander.

09:58.960 --> 09:59.550
What...

09:59.750 --> 10:00.360
What happened?

10:00.360 --> 10:01.020
Commander!

10:01.600 --> 10:02.000
Madam,

10:02.550 --> 10:04.120
with the Commander's skills,

10:04.120 --> 10:07.920
how many people in this world
could ever get close enough to harm him?

10:12.600 --> 10:13.510
Chen Qingyuan,

10:14.120 --> 10:15.670
out of personal grudge,
you murdered your husband,

10:15.670 --> 10:17.510
Shen Run, a second-rank court official

10:17.510 --> 10:19.750
and Commander of the Palace Guard.

10:20.360 --> 10:21.600
The evidence is conclusive,

10:21.600 --> 10:22.910
and we've caught you red-handed.

10:22.910 --> 10:23.750
Seize her!

10:23.750 --> 10:24.390
Feng En!

10:25.390 --> 10:26.630
The Commander's body isn't even cold yet,

10:26.630 --> 10:28.600
and you dare slander his wife like this?

10:28.600 --> 10:29.120
Feng En,

10:29.500 --> 10:30.840
the truth hasn't been established yet.

10:30.840 --> 10:31.910
What are you really after,

10:31.910 --> 10:34.170
pinning this crime on her so recklessly?

10:36.200 --> 10:38.440
Commander Shen unfortunately
died in the line of duty.

10:38.440 --> 10:39.770
By His Majesty's order,

10:39.910 --> 10:41.790
I've been appointed Acting Commander.

10:41.790 --> 10:43.320
Apprehending the real culprit

10:43.320 --> 10:44.390
is my duty.

10:44.870 --> 10:47.750
Just because she's the Commander's widow,

10:47.910 --> 10:51.000
does that mean she should be cleared of
suspicion for having blood on her hands?

10:51.000 --> 10:52.060
Acting Commander?

10:52.270 --> 10:53.790
The Commander has just
met with misfortune.

10:53.790 --> 10:55.360
Where did the imperial order come from?

10:55.360 --> 10:57.220
Have you sold yourself to Hu Xing?

10:57.360 --> 10:58.120
Traitor.

10:58.440 --> 10:59.960
Whether she's the true culprit or not,

10:59.960 --> 11:02.490
His Majesty and Commissioner Hu
will decide.

11:03.120 --> 11:03.920
Take her away!

11:04.240 --> 11:06.030
-Who dares to move?
-I'm the Second-Rank Lady of Honor,

11:06.030 --> 11:07.670
conferred by His Majesty himself.

11:07.670 --> 11:08.630
To take me away,

11:08.790 --> 11:10.550
you'll need
the Court of Judicial Review's fish tally,

11:10.550 --> 11:12.870
a warrant from the Vice Censor-in-Chief,

11:12.870 --> 11:14.480
and His Majesty's own vermilion rescript.

11:14.480 --> 11:16.280
Only then will I so much as blink.

11:16.480 --> 11:18.410
If this is reported to His Majesty,

11:18.440 --> 11:19.770
every one of you will die

11:20.080 --> 11:21.270
before I do!

11:24.870 --> 11:26.930
Want to torture me into a confession,

11:26.960 --> 11:28.840
then silence me forever
so I can't contradict it?

11:28.840 --> 11:29.570
I don't think

11:30.120 --> 11:31.380
you have what it takes.

11:32.840 --> 11:33.440
Very well.

11:34.480 --> 11:36.140
Palace Guards, hear my order—

11:36.550 --> 11:37.550
from this day forward,

11:37.550 --> 11:39.480
guard the Shen Residence closely,

11:39.480 --> 11:42.510
especially this criminal woman
who killed your commander!

11:42.510 --> 11:43.320
Yes, sir!

12:07.030 --> 12:08.790
I've already had
the coroner examine the body.

12:08.790 --> 12:10.690
The knife wound
was indeed inflicted by this person,

12:10.690 --> 12:12.950
and Shen Run showed no sign of breathing.

12:13.270 --> 12:14.800
He is unquestionably dead.

12:32.320 --> 12:32.960
Good!

12:33.600 --> 12:36.130
A wise man knows
which way the wind is blowing.

12:37.550 --> 12:38.270
You...

12:40.080 --> 12:41.440
are a wise man.

12:42.240 --> 12:44.270
Though you serve His Majesty,

12:44.840 --> 12:46.000
you understand that

12:46.670 --> 12:48.720
now that the new Emperor
has ascended the throne,

12:48.720 --> 12:50.150
his ambitions

12:50.720 --> 12:51.910
are nothing more

12:52.390 --> 12:53.870
than a passing breeze.

12:54.240 --> 12:56.970
At most, it can strip
a few leaves from the tree.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.450
But the great tree's

12:59.270 --> 13:01.730
roots run deep,
tangled beyond all tracing—

13:02.320 --> 13:04.180
nothing can shake it to its roots.

13:04.240 --> 13:05.480
Once the wind passes,

13:06.510 --> 13:07.600
everyone will

13:08.480 --> 13:10.210
settle back into their places.

13:10.630 --> 13:13.480
And those who bend with the wind

13:14.150 --> 13:15.410
will meet a tragic end.

13:16.070 --> 13:17.870
You're right, Commissioner Hu.

13:18.030 --> 13:19.510
I've long since come to understand this.

13:19.510 --> 13:20.910
Now that Shen Run is dead,

13:21.120 --> 13:23.920
I stand the best chance
of becoming the Commander.

13:23.960 --> 13:24.750
But for that,

13:25.120 --> 13:27.380
I still need your help, Commissioner Hu.

13:34.750 --> 13:35.510
I've

13:36.270 --> 13:38.550
always treated smart people well.

13:38.790 --> 13:39.590
Rest assured.

13:39.870 --> 13:42.110
Whatever I have,

13:43.320 --> 13:45.030
you'll have your share.

13:45.870 --> 13:47.470
Thank you, Commissioner Hu.

13:54.000 --> 13:55.030
Nine years ago,

13:56.600 --> 13:57.630
Lord Shen Zhibai,

13:59.120 --> 14:01.320
the Jiangnan Transport Commissioner,

14:02.320 --> 14:03.850
sat right in this very chair

14:04.790 --> 14:07.270
and wrote
the Ten Suggestions on Equalization.

14:07.270 --> 14:09.000
At that time, we truly believed

14:09.360 --> 14:12.080
the people would be well-fed
and warmly clothed from then on.

14:12.080 --> 14:13.740
But who would have thought...

14:14.960 --> 14:18.690
he'd be framed by the officials here
who joined forces against him.

14:19.240 --> 14:20.970
and die in the prime of his life?

14:22.120 --> 14:23.120
Nine years later,

14:23.910 --> 14:25.200
his eldest son,

14:25.460 --> 14:28.860
[Commander of the Palace Guard Shen Run]

14:25.870 --> 14:28.360
Shen Run, Commander of the Palace Guard,

14:29.030 --> 14:32.240
who was carrying out the Emperor's order
to investigate the old cases,

14:32.240 --> 14:33.900
likewise met a violent death.

14:34.820 --> 14:37.410
[Mengliang]

14:38.750 --> 14:39.550
Gentlemen,

14:40.200 --> 14:42.000
seeing you all return safely

14:42.720 --> 14:45.390
has finally

14:46.120 --> 14:46.840
lifted

14:47.440 --> 14:48.960
a weight from my heart.

14:50.670 --> 14:52.550
You're too kind, Commissioner Hu.

14:52.550 --> 14:54.480
When it comes to the affairs of the court,

14:54.480 --> 14:55.670
we are too insignificant

14:55.670 --> 14:56.800
to have any real say.

14:57.320 --> 15:00.120
But now,
with refugees flooding across Jiangnan,

15:00.670 --> 15:02.270
if we turn a blind eye to this,

15:03.030 --> 15:06.960
all our years of studying the sages' teachings
will have been for nothing.

15:06.960 --> 15:08.620
Yet with Commander Shen dead,

15:09.390 --> 15:11.480
the corrupt officials he once imprisoned

15:11.480 --> 15:12.940
have all been reinstated.

15:13.830 --> 15:14.900
In Hengtang,

15:15.550 --> 15:18.750
is anyone still willing to
listen to the people's voices?

15:20.240 --> 15:21.510
To our opponent,

15:22.630 --> 15:23.560
Commander Shen.

15:24.120 --> 15:26.050
He has fought against us for years.

15:26.080 --> 15:28.610
Today, everything can
finally be put to rest.

15:29.150 --> 15:31.720
We ought to send him off properly.

15:36.480 --> 15:38.720
If no one in Hengtang
is willing to listen,

15:38.720 --> 15:40.050
we'll go to the capital.

15:40.390 --> 15:41.920
If they still can't hear us,

15:42.120 --> 15:43.520
then we'll shout louder.

15:43.900 --> 15:47.470
[Memorial Tablet of the Late Shen Run]

15:44.600 --> 15:45.910
If we're still not loud enough,

15:45.910 --> 15:47.710
then we'll shout with our lives!

15:48.360 --> 15:49.960
The heads of Hengtang's 100,000 citizens,

15:49.960 --> 15:51.550
one by one,

15:51.550 --> 15:53.630
could stretch all the way
to the steps of the imperial throne!

15:53.630 --> 15:55.030
I refuse to believe that,

15:56.150 --> 15:58.080
no matter how powerful Hu Xing is,

15:59.320 --> 16:01.320
he can keep all of us under his thumb.

16:02.270 --> 16:02.960
Now,

16:04.320 --> 16:05.600
Shen Run is gone.

16:06.200 --> 16:07.360
At last, Hengtang

16:07.550 --> 16:09.270
can see clear skies again.

16:09.670 --> 16:10.480
Indeed.

16:11.510 --> 16:12.870
I hope you will

16:13.360 --> 16:14.440
all return to your posts,

16:14.440 --> 16:16.490
regroup, and rise once more.

16:16.750 --> 16:19.600
We must regain control of Hengtang.

16:20.150 --> 16:20.880
The rules...

16:22.750 --> 16:24.600
remain as they always were—

16:25.200 --> 16:26.200
your interests

16:26.480 --> 16:27.870
will remain yours.

16:29.960 --> 16:31.080
Any objections?

16:31.960 --> 16:33.000
Commissioner Hu.

16:35.000 --> 16:36.320
For the imperial court,

16:36.320 --> 16:37.790
for you, Commissioner Hu,

16:38.120 --> 16:40.180
we shall serve with utmost devotion!

16:42.080 --> 16:42.600
Good.

16:43.600 --> 16:44.320
Then...

16:44.910 --> 16:46.750
let us celebrate!

16:48.870 --> 16:49.840
Come on!

16:49.840 --> 16:50.670
Drink. Let's drink.

16:50.670 --> 16:51.730
Come on, fill it up.

16:56.080 --> 16:57.510
Hengtang is ours again!

16:57.510 --> 16:58.120
Yeah!

16:58.790 --> 17:00.670
It's still ours!

17:13.440 --> 17:14.839
Smells nice, doesn't it?

17:18.349 --> 17:20.680
This is the first jar of aged wine
we sealed

17:21.030 --> 17:22.510
when we first arrived at Hengtang.

17:22.510 --> 17:23.369
A fine vintage.

17:27.030 --> 17:28.160
I've said it before.

17:29.350 --> 17:30.270
This jar of wine

17:31.030 --> 17:33.070
must be saved for an important day,

17:34.070 --> 17:37.270
to share with important people

17:37.680 --> 17:38.940
and mark the occasion.

17:42.640 --> 17:43.400
Yuting,

17:44.200 --> 17:45.000
what's wrong?

17:55.720 --> 17:58.520
Today, everything has
finally fallen into place.

17:58.640 --> 18:00.640
It's a day to celebrate our victory.

18:00.830 --> 18:03.200
Why do you seem so downcast instead?

18:09.070 --> 18:11.270
I just suddenly feel all this is a bit...

18:11.830 --> 18:12.640
dull.

18:19.790 --> 18:20.960
Dull?

18:22.880 --> 18:24.680
Returning to Hengtang this time

18:25.510 --> 18:27.200
was your idea.

18:27.720 --> 18:29.580
Controlling the canal transport

18:29.590 --> 18:31.720
and contesting your family headship—

18:33.110 --> 18:34.480
haven't you

18:35.350 --> 18:37.210
achieved everything you wanted?

18:38.590 --> 18:40.030
What else do you wish for?

18:41.160 --> 18:42.890
I'll help you achieve that too.

18:45.790 --> 18:47.320
Whether it's in the capital

18:47.590 --> 18:48.790
or in Hengtang,

18:49.270 --> 18:50.510
it's always

18:51.350 --> 18:53.030
the same handful of faces

18:53.310 --> 18:55.170
and the same handful of families.

18:57.310 --> 18:58.680
And so what if we win?

19:00.550 --> 19:02.240
It's just a different stage

19:02.640 --> 19:04.030
for the same old play.

19:11.640 --> 19:12.500
I'm tired of it.

19:16.720 --> 19:19.250
We finally came across
someone interesting.

19:25.880 --> 19:26.790
Look at you.

19:28.110 --> 19:30.240
You've met every kind of man there is.

19:31.400 --> 19:33.400
Why does Shen Run's death

19:34.110 --> 19:35.400
suddenly make you

19:37.030 --> 19:38.510
so sentimental?

19:49.400 --> 19:50.510
It's not about him.

19:52.350 --> 19:54.680
I just feel sorry for that perfect couple.

19:55.880 --> 19:58.350
Before I could tear them apart myself,

19:58.830 --> 20:00.960
they were already separated by death.

20:04.400 --> 20:05.270
It's really

20:05.640 --> 20:07.700
taken some of the fun out of this play.

20:19.310 --> 20:20.070
Here.

21:40.480 --> 21:42.140
In the past, we wrote articles

21:42.590 --> 21:44.510
so they would circulate in the capital.

21:44.510 --> 21:45.970
But this piece we write now

21:47.200 --> 21:48.600
isn't for the officials,

21:49.720 --> 21:51.180
nor to protect ourselves.

21:52.270 --> 21:54.470
It's for whatever shred of humanity...

21:56.790 --> 21:58.390
still remains in our hearts.

22:05.550 --> 22:07.010
The article is finalized.

22:07.640 --> 22:09.750
If any of you don't want to
be implicated in this,

22:09.750 --> 22:10.880
you may leave now.

22:11.510 --> 22:13.110
Those of you willing to stay,

22:14.110 --> 22:15.310
join me

22:16.480 --> 22:18.080
in sending this article out.

22:22.590 --> 22:23.590
Lord Shen Zhibai

22:23.590 --> 22:24.590
and Commander Shen Run—

22:24.590 --> 22:26.640
both gave their lives
for the common people.

22:26.640 --> 22:27.790
How could we possibly be afraid

22:27.790 --> 22:30.160
to put our names to this proclamation?

22:31.680 --> 22:32.880
To plead for the people,

22:32.880 --> 22:34.200
I'd die without regret!

22:34.200 --> 22:36.240
I'd gladly go with you, Jieyuan Zhou!

22:36.240 --> 22:38.450
I'd gladly go with you, Jieyuan Zhou!

22:41.400 --> 22:42.310
Mr. Zhou!

23:01.640 --> 23:02.550
Third Lady Xie.

23:04.110 --> 23:04.920
Mr. Zhou.

23:08.510 --> 23:09.350
This time,

23:09.550 --> 23:11.080
don't copy the wrong sutra.

23:11.590 --> 23:12.920
Thank you, Senior Zhou.

23:13.480 --> 23:14.680
If it weren't for you,

23:14.790 --> 23:18.190
I don't know how many times
I would've copied the wrong sutra.

23:18.400 --> 23:20.930
And thank you for
keeping these papers for me.

23:20.960 --> 23:21.880
It's clear

23:22.160 --> 23:23.960
how deeply you miss your mother.

23:24.310 --> 23:25.030
How about

23:25.400 --> 23:27.130
I draw a portrait of her for you?

23:28.510 --> 23:30.110
You know how to paint as well?

23:35.270 --> 23:38.270
I don't remember much of her.

23:39.750 --> 23:41.030
I only remember Mother

23:41.640 --> 23:43.040
had a crisp, clear laugh.

23:43.270 --> 23:46.750
Her hair was very dark and glossy.

23:48.160 --> 23:49.720
Whenever she held me,

23:50.270 --> 23:52.200
her hands always smelled so sweet.

23:52.310 --> 23:54.640
When Mother was pregnant with my brother,

23:54.720 --> 23:57.400
everyone was careful
not to let her tire herself out.

23:57.400 --> 23:58.660
But Mother doted on me.

23:59.550 --> 24:01.010
She would always pick me up

24:01.640 --> 24:03.170
and spin me around the room.

24:08.830 --> 24:09.640
She...

24:11.350 --> 24:13.150
always spoke slowly and gently,

24:13.590 --> 24:15.050
never sharply or harshly,

24:15.590 --> 24:18.110
and her hair at the temples
was never messy.

24:23.070 --> 24:24.550
She had deep-set eyes,

24:25.200 --> 24:27.640
with the corners of her eyes
slightly curved upward.

24:27.640 --> 24:29.300
But if anyone ever bullied me,

24:29.640 --> 24:31.370
her eyes would narrow sharply,

24:31.880 --> 24:33.940
and she wouldn't back down to anyone.

24:41.310 --> 24:42.270
Your mother

24:42.680 --> 24:44.680
sounds like a truly special person.

24:46.270 --> 24:47.750
Why do you say that?

24:51.920 --> 24:54.180
No matter how neatly her hair was combed,

24:54.240 --> 24:55.440
it would come loose

24:55.960 --> 24:57.640
if she spun you around the room.

24:57.640 --> 24:58.750
You said

24:59.720 --> 25:01.380
her laugh was crisp and clear,

25:01.510 --> 25:03.680
yet her speech was slow and gentle.

25:05.270 --> 25:07.960
That doesn't sound like the same person.

25:12.440 --> 25:13.960
Senior Zhou, you mean

25:15.270 --> 25:16.470
I remember her wrong?

25:19.440 --> 25:21.300
Could it be two different people—

25:21.790 --> 25:24.250
one fierce on the outside
but gentle within,

25:24.350 --> 25:27.350
and the other gentle on the outside
but fierce within?

25:27.400 --> 25:30.440
It's just that you've
merged both of their virtues

25:31.350 --> 25:33.350
into a single person in your memory.

26:08.000 --> 26:08.720
Mother,

26:09.350 --> 26:11.080
the herbal decoction is ready.

26:12.070 --> 26:13.130
Careful, it's hot.

26:17.920 --> 26:19.920
It was only a minor illness at first,

26:20.310 --> 26:21.910
and I didn't think much of it.

26:22.400 --> 26:25.160
Who would've thought
it'd get worse day by day?

26:25.550 --> 26:27.750
I've taken
several doses of the decoction already,

26:27.750 --> 26:29.610
but there's been no improvement.

26:33.550 --> 26:36.070
Perhaps the decoction
just takes time to work.

26:36.070 --> 26:37.270
Take a few more doses.

26:38.000 --> 26:39.270
I'm sure it'll help.

26:43.510 --> 26:46.240
The decoction I prepared for you
with my own hands

26:46.510 --> 26:48.770
carries all my filial devotion, Mother.

26:50.070 --> 26:51.590
Even Mr. Zhou said

26:53.070 --> 26:54.530
that my painting of Mother

26:55.030 --> 26:57.290
has traces of two different people in it.

26:57.680 --> 26:59.680
You've raised me since I was a child.

26:59.920 --> 27:03.850
Honestly, I barely remember
what my birth mother looked like anymore.

27:06.030 --> 27:07.400
The mother in my heart

27:07.960 --> 27:09.960
has actually always worn your face.

27:32.880 --> 27:33.680
Mother,

27:34.640 --> 27:35.700
was my birth mother

27:36.590 --> 27:38.640
really poisoned by euphorbia?

27:46.720 --> 27:48.850
The wicked deed Mei Yinghua committed

27:49.440 --> 27:51.170
has already been established.

27:51.790 --> 27:53.240
Why are you

27:54.550 --> 27:56.350
bringing this up all of a sudden?

27:58.640 --> 27:59.680
I heard

28:00.720 --> 28:03.640
my birth mother's lips
were purple when she died.

28:05.880 --> 28:08.140
That's not a sign of euphorbia poisoning

28:10.030 --> 28:11.160
but of suffocation.

28:16.000 --> 28:17.240
I knew it.

28:17.750 --> 28:19.160
While I've been ill,

28:19.160 --> 28:20.880
someone's been filling your head
with nonsense again.

28:20.880 --> 28:21.480
Mother.

28:23.920 --> 28:26.780
What you had me copy
was not the Rebirth Sutra at all,

28:28.440 --> 28:30.370
but the Soul-Suppressing Mantra,

28:30.830 --> 28:31.480
right?

28:40.720 --> 28:41.960
How is that possible?

28:42.590 --> 28:43.440
Indeed.

28:45.590 --> 28:47.050
How could my loving mother

28:48.790 --> 28:52.320
ever have me personally
suppress the spirit of my birth mother?

28:59.680 --> 29:00.550
How could I...

29:01.350 --> 29:02.400
have had you copy

29:02.680 --> 29:04.410
the Soul-Suppressing Mantra?

29:06.400 --> 29:08.330
Maybe you've copied the wrong one.

29:12.550 --> 29:13.790
Maybe you've copied the wrong one.

29:13.790 --> 29:14.720
I'll go check.

29:18.160 --> 29:20.220
Indeed. You've copied the wrong one.

29:20.590 --> 29:21.240
Well...

29:21.790 --> 29:23.400
Indeed, wrong sutra!

29:25.790 --> 29:27.390
It must've been some servant

29:28.000 --> 29:29.530
who mixed up the two sutras.

29:29.830 --> 29:30.860
I'm to blame.

29:30.920 --> 29:32.200
I'm to blame!

29:35.720 --> 29:38.750
Let's copy the right sutra later, okay?

29:38.880 --> 29:40.410
Let's copy the right sutra,

29:40.920 --> 29:41.750
okay?

29:43.480 --> 29:44.510
Wrong sutra?

29:45.640 --> 29:46.510
Mother,

29:48.030 --> 29:50.030
was it really just a mistake?

29:55.240 --> 29:55.880
Qingrong,

29:56.750 --> 29:57.950
do you really believe

29:58.240 --> 30:00.160
I would harm your mother?

30:05.920 --> 30:06.920
You've been

30:07.920 --> 30:09.640
my daughter for 19 years.

30:10.550 --> 30:11.960
How have I treated you?

30:13.750 --> 30:15.510
Don't you trust me?

30:19.480 --> 30:20.720
Trust me,

30:23.240 --> 30:23.880
okay?

30:38.000 --> 30:39.550
Of course I trust Mother.

30:43.070 --> 30:44.270
Good girl, Qingrong.

30:47.110 --> 30:48.110
My good Qingrong.

30:53.960 --> 30:54.680
Mother.

30:58.000 --> 30:59.660
It's time for your decoction.

31:39.830 --> 31:41.510
I'll definitely finish...

31:44.000 --> 31:45.030
the decoction

31:46.070 --> 31:47.310
you brewed for me.

32:07.750 --> 32:11.110
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

32:11.110 --> 32:14.380
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

32:14.380 --> 32:17.480
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

32:17.480 --> 32:20.200
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

32:20.200 --> 32:23.440
-These scholars.
-Purge the corrupt officials!

32:24.110 --> 32:27.670
-They shout nonstop all day.
-Cleanse the Emperor's court!

32:27.700 --> 32:31.160
Purge the corrupt officials
and cleanse the Emperor's court!

32:31.400 --> 32:34.400
–Purge the corrupt officials!
-It's OK. Let's drink.

32:34.720 --> 32:35.830
Young people

32:35.830 --> 32:38.030
always carry lofty ideals.

32:38.160 --> 32:40.690
Naturally, they tend to be
a bit hot-blooded.

32:40.880 --> 32:41.550
Yes, yes.

32:41.550 --> 32:43.830
Look how magnanimous Commissioner Hu is.

32:43.830 --> 32:45.030
I heard

32:45.590 --> 32:48.030
the one leading them

32:48.200 --> 32:49.350
is Zhou Pei'an, right?

32:49.350 --> 32:51.590
He's even the top scholar in
the provincial imperial exam here, right?

32:51.590 --> 32:52.200
Yes.

32:52.240 --> 32:53.240
Yes, yes.

32:53.240 --> 32:54.750
What's so great about a top scholar
in the provincial imperial exam?

32:54.750 --> 32:56.400
Even the top scorer in the palace exam—

32:56.400 --> 32:58.330
one comes along every three years.

32:58.480 --> 32:59.680
Since the founding of our dynasty,

32:59.680 --> 33:01.640
there have been nearly a hundred of them.

33:01.640 --> 33:02.550
A mere Jieyuan

33:02.550 --> 33:03.680
is nothing special.

33:03.840 --> 33:05.000
-Yeah.
-Yes.

33:05.440 --> 33:08.070
How many truly
prominent aristocratic families

33:08.070 --> 33:09.330
are there in the realm?

33:10.110 --> 33:11.240
Those students

33:11.550 --> 33:13.070
will never amount to anything.

33:13.070 --> 33:14.000
However much of a fuss they make,

33:14.000 --> 33:15.480
could it possibly beat the uproar
Shen Zhibai made back then?

33:15.480 --> 33:16.160
Exactly.

33:16.550 --> 33:17.350
That's right.

33:17.440 --> 33:18.970
Even if he makes a huge fuss,

33:19.240 --> 33:20.720
once he offends Commissioner Hu,

33:20.720 --> 33:23.640
his whole family
could be wiped out in an instant.

33:27.030 --> 33:27.790
My Lords,

33:28.720 --> 33:30.160
the two generals have arrived.

33:30.160 --> 33:31.690
Who are these two generals?

33:32.070 --> 33:33.730
Greetings, Commissioner Hu!

33:41.240 --> 33:42.920
We've been waiting for you.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.070
They're

33:46.550 --> 33:48.750
Deputy Commander Wang
and Deputy Commander Zhao.

33:48.750 --> 33:50.920
They're renowned battle-hardened generals.

33:50.920 --> 33:51.750
Exactly.

33:52.750 --> 33:54.750
The right-hand men
of the Marquis of Danyang.

33:54.750 --> 33:55.720
Right, right.

33:56.440 --> 33:57.400
Commissioner Hu,

33:57.400 --> 33:59.660
you truly are blessed with good fortune.

34:02.310 --> 34:03.200
You flatter me.

34:03.830 --> 34:05.160
These two generals

34:05.720 --> 34:07.590
are merely doing me the honor of coming.

34:07.590 --> 34:08.510
No, no, My Lord.

34:09.030 --> 34:10.760
We've long heard of
your formidable reputation.

34:10.760 --> 34:11.960
How could we not come?

34:12.230 --> 34:13.230
Generals,

34:13.920 --> 34:16.150
you've served under Li Shaoqun,

34:17.070 --> 34:18.510
Marquis of Danyang,

34:19.760 --> 34:21.560
for quite a long time now, right?

34:23.400 --> 34:25.280
Now, as you can see,

34:27.480 --> 34:29.940
he's shut himself away
behind closed doors.

34:30.070 --> 34:31.320
I believe

34:31.840 --> 34:34.480
it's time for the two of you

34:34.840 --> 34:36.110
to step forward.

34:36.550 --> 34:38.030
Time to come out,

34:38.280 --> 34:39.360
take a look around,

34:39.760 --> 34:41.150
and make a choice.

34:47.920 --> 34:48.550
Yes.

34:49.880 --> 34:52.000
I heard that Li Shaoqun has

34:52.550 --> 34:54.949
recently become quite the benevolent man,

34:55.000 --> 34:57.280
wanting to use all the soldiers' rations

34:57.280 --> 34:58.480
for disaster relief.

34:58.800 --> 35:00.710
When Li Shaoqun is around,

35:00.710 --> 35:02.400
he commands respect and keeps order.

35:02.400 --> 35:04.670
But once he's gone,

35:04.880 --> 35:06.880
with only that pampered

35:06.880 --> 35:08.000
young son of his,

35:08.150 --> 35:10.410
what could his son possibly accomplish?

35:10.440 --> 35:11.230
When the time comes,

35:11.230 --> 35:12.280
he won't be able to
hold things together at all.

35:12.280 --> 35:13.630
What could he accomplish?

35:13.630 --> 35:14.710
Generals,

35:15.190 --> 35:17.030
you'd better think carefully.

35:21.590 --> 35:22.280
You two,

35:24.190 --> 35:25.280
do you understand?

35:27.440 --> 35:28.280
Generals,

35:29.320 --> 35:30.630
what do you say?

35:37.670 --> 35:40.270
We're willing to follow you,
Commissioner Hu!

35:45.110 --> 35:48.440
After the incident,
I was brought back to the Xie Residence.

35:49.280 --> 35:52.030
I heard it was Old Madam who intervened,

35:52.960 --> 35:54.760
having Xie Shu persuade Hu Xing.

35:57.230 --> 35:59.030
Returning to the Xie Residence,

35:59.110 --> 36:01.150
I felt like a lost, wandering soul.

36:01.920 --> 36:05.710
Then, by chance,
I stumbled upon a shocking secret.

36:07.670 --> 36:09.760
My Lady, dinner is ready!

36:25.870 --> 36:27.570
[Lu Lingshu]

36:29.230 --> 36:30.590
My Lady?

36:31.660 --> 36:34.850
[Lu Lingshu]

36:37.670 --> 36:44.980
[Zhongwu Hall]

36:49.510 --> 36:50.280
Father.

36:53.360 --> 36:54.190
Chunzhi.

36:55.630 --> 36:56.230
Come here.

36:59.700 --> 37:01.780
[Zhongwu Hall]

37:06.400 --> 37:06.960
Sit.

37:08.730 --> 37:15.090
[Zhongwu Hall]

37:14.710 --> 37:15.320
Father.

37:16.760 --> 37:18.110
Since Commander Shen passed away,

37:18.110 --> 37:20.230
everything in Hengtang
has fallen into disarray.

37:20.230 --> 37:21.800
Father, do you have any plans

37:21.800 --> 37:23.130
regarding this matter?

37:26.070 --> 37:26.880
Chunzhi,

37:27.800 --> 37:28.760
recently,

37:29.280 --> 37:30.710
because of your marriage,

37:30.710 --> 37:33.110
you haven't stepped
out of the house at all—

37:33.320 --> 37:35.720
you haven't even gone to
the military camp.

37:35.960 --> 37:37.560
I've been worried about you.

37:39.760 --> 37:40.360
Yes.

37:40.920 --> 37:41.920
It's my fault.

37:42.710 --> 37:44.840
I'm sorry to have worried you, Father.

37:45.280 --> 37:46.340
But Qingru and I...

37:46.670 --> 37:47.550
I know.

37:49.320 --> 37:51.190
You've always been thinking about

37:51.190 --> 37:53.120
the Xie family's fourth daughter.

37:54.840 --> 37:57.110
The moment you lifted the bridal veil,

37:58.670 --> 37:59.670
your mother and I

38:00.320 --> 38:01.670
could already see

38:01.670 --> 38:03.130
the reproach in your eyes.

38:04.590 --> 38:06.190
But what could be done?

38:07.000 --> 38:08.590
That's simply fate.

38:12.630 --> 38:13.800
Back then,

38:14.510 --> 38:16.320
your mother and I were the same.

38:17.630 --> 38:18.710
After the wedding,

38:19.070 --> 38:20.670
we also had some bumps.

38:20.670 --> 38:22.320
Your mother, in a fit of anger,

38:22.320 --> 38:23.840
packed her belongings

38:24.510 --> 38:26.370
and ran back to her parents' home.

38:28.400 --> 38:30.730
I've never heard you speak of this before.

38:32.550 --> 38:33.440
Chunzhi,

38:34.030 --> 38:35.070
marriage is a bond

38:35.630 --> 38:37.960
forged across 3 lifetimes,

38:38.440 --> 38:40.230
a fate cultivated over 1,000 years.

38:40.230 --> 38:43.320
You can't let a few harsh words
in a moment of anger

38:43.670 --> 38:45.630
sever that bond, right?

38:49.320 --> 38:50.070
Later,

38:50.840 --> 38:53.400
I took 2 jars of the finest aged wine

38:53.760 --> 38:55.420
to your grandfather's house.

38:56.000 --> 38:59.190
That very night, your grandfather and I
drank deep into the night.

38:59.190 --> 39:00.000
And then?

39:00.670 --> 39:02.330
The very next day, your mother

39:02.480 --> 39:03.740
came back home with me.

39:05.670 --> 39:07.600
Though with conditions attached.

39:07.840 --> 39:08.880
From that day forward,

39:08.880 --> 39:09.550
your mother

39:10.440 --> 39:14.230
made me promise
not to strike back, not to talk back.

39:14.670 --> 39:15.710
And I've kept to that,

39:15.710 --> 39:16.480
haven't I?

39:18.960 --> 39:20.070
Father, you're

39:20.590 --> 39:21.990
giving me a gentle nudge.

39:23.590 --> 39:24.880
A true man

39:25.920 --> 39:27.320
stands tall and upright.

39:31.110 --> 39:32.510
In this life...

39:36.230 --> 39:38.480
the one who accompanies you until the end

39:38.480 --> 39:39.610
is not your parents,

39:40.480 --> 39:41.590
nor your children,

39:42.280 --> 39:44.030
but your wife.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.630
She's like a mirror,

39:46.960 --> 39:48.690
reflecting your state of mind.

39:51.360 --> 39:53.030
Qingru is a fine girl.

39:53.480 --> 39:55.440
Once you've spent enough years together,

39:55.440 --> 39:56.440
and you reach my age,

39:56.440 --> 39:57.570
you'll understand—

39:58.480 --> 40:00.840
what kind of wife she becomes

40:01.400 --> 40:04.030
and what kind of mother she becomes

40:04.480 --> 40:05.670
isn't just up to her,

40:06.320 --> 40:07.320
but up to you.

40:11.840 --> 40:12.640
I understand.

40:13.360 --> 40:14.620
I understand, Father.

40:15.150 --> 40:17.750
I'll certainly
shoulder the responsibility.

40:19.150 --> 40:19.920
Chunzhi,

40:22.110 --> 40:23.310
in the blink of an eye,

40:23.550 --> 40:25.000
you've grown up.

40:26.510 --> 40:27.440
All grown up.

40:29.880 --> 40:30.590
Yes.

40:31.590 --> 40:32.670
Lately,

40:32.670 --> 40:35.480
I've often heard some things about you.

40:36.190 --> 40:37.070
They say

40:37.550 --> 40:39.190
that you're kind-hearted

40:39.550 --> 40:41.080
and have no ill intentions,

40:41.800 --> 40:43.070
so it'll be hard for you to preserve

40:43.070 --> 40:45.550
the future of our family.

40:46.510 --> 40:48.150
So what?

40:48.150 --> 40:51.190
You've already grown into the person
I hoped you'd be.

40:51.760 --> 40:53.710
Who cares what others say?

40:59.480 --> 41:00.880
From now on...

41:05.840 --> 41:06.960
whatever...

41:10.840 --> 41:12.550
becomes of

41:12.840 --> 41:14.370
this Marquis's household,

41:14.840 --> 41:16.840
it shall have nothing to do with you.

41:18.230 --> 41:19.550
You are simply you.

41:22.400 --> 41:24.030
Just being yourself

41:24.760 --> 41:25.800
is enough.
